    "sections": {
        "description": "The Online Organic Store Theme provides a structured layout for presenting products, categories, images, and business information in a clear format. Its responsive design adjusts content for desktop, tablet, and mobile screens, helping maintain consistent page layouts across devices. The theme includes customizable sections that can be arranged to display featured products, category information, promotional content, and other website elements. Navigation menus can be used to organize important pages and product sections, while image areas provide space for showcasing products and related visuals. The theme supports WooCommerce, allowing ecommerce functionality to be added for product listings, shopping carts, checkout, and order management. Typography, colors, layouts, and other visual elements can be adjusted through available customization options. The theme can also include standard sections such as About, Services, Contact, and other informational pages. Its page structure is suitable for websites that require a combination of product presentation and general business content. Content can be updated through the site administration interface, allowing product details, images, categories, and text to be maintained as the website develops."
    },
